Package: EGAnetLab
Title: Exploratory Graph Analysis Lab for Dimensional Structure
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Arquímedes De León", "Chacón Chacón", email = "arquimedeschacon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(affiliation = "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"))
Description: A jamovi module that exposes the network psychometrics methods
    of the EGAnet package (Exploratory Graph Analysis, bootstrap stability,
    redundancy analysis, hierarchical, dynamic and invariance extensions) and
    pairs every result with evidence-based methodological guidance,
    plain-language interpretation and educational support.
License: GPL-3
